      "widgets_values": [
        "START HERE \u2014 generate the first video and save continuation state.\n1. Upload a first-frame image. Set width/height on Output canvas (multiples of 32). Center crop is explicit.\n2. Edit the prompt; <Picture 1> is the resized first frame. Extra references start at <Picture 2>.\n3. Set duration on Prepare Latent Generation and queue. Defaults: 10 seconds, base model, 30 steps, RES multistep + Simple.\n4. Save Take writes h3_test/root_<id>.mp4 AND root_<id>.safetensors, containing the final sampled video/audio latent.\n5. Paste the .safetensors path into Lazy Load H3 State in H3-State-Continuation-Test. Select tail_5 or tail_22.\nNo previous latent file is required. The complete opening clip is kept. Existing workflows are unchanged."
      ]
    }
